Deposit silver in one city, withdraw in another.
一地存银·异地兑付

5
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:11,200
At its peak, 57 branches across 35 cities.
鼎盛时·35城57家分号

6
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:13,600
A full Ming-era wall still rings the old town.
明代城墙·仍完整环城

7
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:16,000
Six kilometres of ramparts, cannon scars and all.
六公里城墙·留着炮痕

8
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,400
Grey courtyards and old shopfronts, Ming and Qing.
明清院落·老字号临街

9
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:20,800
A UNESCO World Heritage site since 1997.
1997年·列入世界遗产

10
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:23,600
★ Expert Tip: Walk the full wall at dawn, before the crowds.
★清晨绕城墙·避开人潮

11
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:26,400
A paper draft, or hard silver — which would you trust?
纸票还是白银·你信哪个？
